cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "2D Tumor Angiogenesis Simulation"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Hossam
    family-names: Mahmoud
repository-code: "https://github.com/SamDozer/2D-Tumor-Angiogenesis-Simulation"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Two-dimensional reaction-diffusion models of tumour growth and angiogenesis
  (Fisher-Kolmogorov diffusion and proliferation coupled to vessel growth),
  implemented in Python with the finite-difference method. Built at the
  Computational Biology Summer School in Coimbra (September 2024) under the
  guidance of Rui Travasso and Matilda Palmeira; the repository keeps the
  original notebooks alongside corrected and extended versions.
keywords:
  - tumor angiogenesis
  - Fisher-Kolmogorov equation
  - reaction-diffusion
  - finite-difference method
  - computational biology
